remarks.p:
If the property is True then the text inside the text box gets oriented
   so it is readable when looking straight up at the sheet or from its right side;
   in other words, the text would never be upside down.

member.value:
InvalidElementId signals that there is no permanent preview view for the document.
Where possible the document's active view will be used to generate the preview upon save;
where there is no active view the document will not include a preview.

member.param:
This value represents the number of planes (taken in order of their addition) which will be used
for exact filtering of individual points. Other planes in the filter will be used for faster,
but inexact filtering based on cells.

member.remarks:
This connector is an item that is a part of another element (duct, pipe, fitting, or equipment etc.).
This connector does not represent the connector element that can be created inside a family;
for that element, refer to .

The placeholders may or may not have physical connection. However
a) The ends of four connectors should intersect at same point;
b) the first and second placeholders should be collinear each other;
c) the third and fourth placeholders should be collinear each other and
d) the third and fourth should have intersection with first or second placeholder.
If connection fails, the placeholders cannot be physically connected.

